guide~
{c---------------------------------------------------------------------------{x
Welcome to Haven of the Embraced.  This is a world loosely based on the
World of Darkness by White Wolf.  You will see many things during your stay
here, and there are some things you will need to know.  Below is a list of
pages that are contained within this book.  To read a page type 'look page#'
i.e.: {Clook page1{x
{c---------------------------------------------------------------------------{x
Table of Contents
 
{MPage1 {x- About Your Character
{MPage2 {x- Getting Started
{MPage3 {x- Freebies
{MPage4 {x- Items and Equipment
{MPage5 {x- Communicating on Haven
{MPage6 {x- Skills and Prayers
{MPage7 {x- Clans, Tribes, Traditions
{MPage8 {x- Immortals and Administration
{MPage9 {x- Haven's Rules
{MPageA {x- Message Boards
{MPageB {x- Frequently Asked Questions
