#ROOMS
#100
Newbie Training Entrance~
A quiet stone vestibule marks the entrance to the initiate training grounds.
Warm torchlight flickers against rough-hewn walls. To the east lies the
Central Temple of Recall.
~
0 12 0
D1
~
~
0 -1 101
