#254
The Scriptorium~
Tall windows light rows of slanted writing desks thick with dust. Across
the far wall hangs an enormous illuminated chart: lines of gold ink run
from every attribute and ability to the skills they unlock.
{y>>> {rA {wPAINTED SIGNBOARD{r stands here. Type '{clook sign{r' to read it! {y<<<{x
{y>>> {rTalk to the guide: '{csay topics{r' lists available guidance. {y<<<{x
~
0 1036 0
E
chart illuminated~
Gold lines run from Dexterity and Brawl to kick, from Wits and Dodge to dodge, and on through hundreds of skills.
~
E
sign signpost post plaque placard tablet signboard painted signboard~
{y+--------------------------------------------------+{x
{y|{w                      SKILLS                      {y|{x
{y+--------------------------------------------------+{x
{w  There is {rno practice and no train{w in Haven.{x
{w  Your dots on {ccs{w unlock skills automatically.{x
{w  {cskillmap{w     - what each skill needs{x
{w  {cskills{w       - what you know now{x
{w  {cweapon_skills{w- check weapon proficiency caps{x
{w  Skills improve by {yusing{w them.{x

{w  Walk {cnorth{w down into the ossuary.{x
{y+--------------------------------------------------+{x
