#255
The Ossuary~
Niches carved into the walls hold skulls stacked in tidy rows, thousands
of them. This is no place of grief: candles burn before every niche, and
fresh flowers are left for each soul that has died and begun again.
{y>>> {rA {wBONE-FRAMED PLAQUE{r stands here. Type '{clook sign{r' to read it! {y<<<{x
{y>>> {rTalk to the guide: '{csay topics{r' lists available guidance. {y<<<{x
~
0 1036 0
E
skulls skull niches bones~
Each skull bears a small number. Some are numbered in the hundreds.
~
