#256
The Belfry~
Wind howls through the open arches of the bell tower. Far below, the
forest stretches away into darkness, and beyond it the distant lights
of the world. A great bronze bell hangs overhead; its toll will carry you
to the New Temple.
{y>>> {rA {wIRON SIGN{r stands here. Type '{clook sign{r' to read it! {y<<<{x
{y>>> {rTalk to the guide: '{csay topics{r' lists available guidance. {y<<<{x
~
0 1036 0
